<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - General Signal said upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - General Signal said upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter upgraded General Signal Corp to buy from accumulate, according to a Dean Witter source.</p>
<p>-- shares were unchanged at 41-7/8 in early morning exchange trade.</p>
</text>
